<title>LATVIA: RTF GAINS AS BLUE CHIPS EXTEND LOSSES.</title>
<headline>RTF GAINS AS BLUE CHIPS EXTEND LOSSES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
