<p>following prices after the morning trade session on Thursday.</p>
<p>Most blue chips extended losses while the Riga Transport</p>
<p>Fleet rose to 1.22 lats from 1.21 and Lode Brick jumped 10</p>
<p>santimes to 2.50 lats.</p>
